    "text": "<p>One plano-convex&nbsp;and one plano-concave lens of the same radius of curvature <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;but of different materials are joined side by side as shown in the figure. If the refractive index of the material of <math><mn>1</mn></math> is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and that of <math><mn>2</mn></math> is<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>, then the focal length of the combination is:<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/80f54a66-1650-4644-b77e-85fa93d3e8b0-image.png\" style=\"width: 185px; height: 200px;\" /></p>",
